{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And HaShem did not give you a heart to know.</b> Even though He, may He be exalted, exerted Himself in His teachings and signs to give you a heart to know, as it says (Exodus 10:2) לְמַעַן תְּסַפֵּר... וִידַעְתֶּם כִּי אֲנִי ה׳ — this intended goal was not attained because of the abundance of their murmurings."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:25.341673056Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}